0:["SMRhSxF0mDD2kPTukehER",[[["",{"children":["apple-voice-style",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["apple-voice-style",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1><span class=\"ident\">Apple</span> Style Voice</h1>\r\n<p>What is the Apple Voice Style or 'Voice of Apple'? It’s that warm, natural, and sincere tone — famously delivered by Jony Ive and echoed in Apple’s TV advertising.</p>\r\n<p>It’s understated, intelligent, and effortlessly clear. These days, many clients request “that Apple tone” for explainer videos, TV spots, and brand narrations — referencing my original Apple TV ads as their benchmark.</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">iPhone</span> TV adverts</h2>\r\n<p>Since voicing the Apple iPhone 5 TV ads, this voice style has become one of my most requested reads — ideal for <a href=\"/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover\" title=\"British TV Advert Voice\">TV</a>, Radio, <a href=\"/what-is-explainer-video-voiceover\" title=\"British Explainer Voiceover\">Web Explainer Videos</a>, and even <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"British eLearning Voiceover\">eLearning</a> or in-store announcements.</p>\r\n<p>The tone is simple, elegant, and precise. A <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"British Commercial Voiceover\">British commercial voiceover</a> style that lets the product do the talking.</p>\r\n<p>Watch the TV ad I voiced here — broadcast across the UAE and admired for its quiet confidence.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V6HuBB4WqxQ","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TV5U0bZm32g","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The <span class=\"ident\">Guy</span> next door</h2>\r\n<p>The same relaxed, confident tone was used for SEAT’s <em>Hidden Heroes</em> series. They needed a calm and conversational narrator to spotlight the people behind their iconic cars — and this Apple-style voice was the perfect fit.</p>\r\n<p>Watch the SEAT promo — it’s a great showcase of how this voice style adapts to human storytelling.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><span class=\"ident\">Relax</span> and take it easy</h2>\r\n<p>Watch the demos — and if this natural, Apple-inspired voice is what you’re after, just get a client approval and we’ll take it from there.</p>\r\n<p>It’s as simple as an Apple product — clean from start to finish.</p>\r\n<p>Apple is known for its simplicity and service. I try to reflect that in everything I do, especially when voicing <a href=\"/microsoft-cloud-explainer-video\" title=\"Explainer Voiceover\">explainer content</a> or calm brand narration.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Get in touch via the contact page\">Drop me a line</a> today — let’s create something smart, stylish, and human.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/apple-voice-style-og.jpg","alt":"Apple Voice Style – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L2",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","apple-voice-style","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L3",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/f31072523b89a06f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en-GB","children":["$","body",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"top-bar"}],["$","$L4",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"children":["$","$L2",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L3",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"404 – Page Not Found"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Sorry, we couldn't find the page you were looking for."}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"page-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","style":{"textAlign":"center","padding":"60px 15px"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","marginBottom":"24px"},"children":"The page you're look